.	http://www.emsl.pnl.gov/ecce:annotation		ORCA, B3LYP-D3BJ/ma-def2-SVP. Intrinsic reaction coordinate (IRC) from the transition state. This calculation shows the path from the transition state down to the ion-dipole complexes on both sides (both branches converged); the end points, -3073.691304 Eh and -3073.699544 Eh, are close to the optimised complexes, -3073.691084 Eh and -3073.699428 Eh.
